3D models and textures

The 3D model used by this mod (src/Harness/assets/, also embedded in the mod's DLL)
was made for this mod by FlanderDev. Its design follows fan art by yakou450770
(https://www.pixiv.net/en/users/35003939; the artwork has since been deleted) of
Daiwa Scarlet (Uma Musume). The code of the mod is under the MIT licence (LICENSE);
this file is about the model only.

